// -------------------------------------------------------------------
// test_proxy_list_model.rc — Common Controls v6 manifest for the test exe
//
// wxcore 3.3.x imports comctl32!GetWindowSubclass (a v6-only export).
// Without a Common-Controls v6 manifest, Windows loads the legacy
// comctl32 v5.82 from System32, which lacks that export, and the
// process aborts at startup with 0xC0000139 (STATUS_ENTRYPOINT_NOT_FOUND).
// The main GUI exe embeds the same manifest via src/ui/icons.rc.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------

1 24 "src/ui/app.manifest"